    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to New Frankfurt, big dog! In STREET DOG LEGEND, you can manage your very own hot dog cart! But like it or not, something strange is brewing in the city... and you may stumble right into the middle of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art style inspired by flash games from the 2000s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the street cart your way: Buy upgrades, set up shop at busier locations, and franchise to maximize cash; or just keep things simple - it's up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make life-or-death decisions in a city-wide conflict between the government and its... er... &quot;adversaries.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets, play minigames on your laptop, and forge your own path as a street dog legend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/846a92dd498608df3b5f1268361f38e7.poster.avif?t=1752092173\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/846a92dd498608df3b5f1268361f38e7.webm?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/846a92dd498608df3b5f1268361f38e7.mp4?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A classic cooking simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing beats a day slinging dogs. Fast and high-quality orders served to customers will earn you LOTS of money and - more importantly - fill that empty hole in your heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/74622ffa3aa70e5449e605254d3ffb84.poster.avif?t=1752092173\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/74622ffa3aa70e5449e605254d3ffb84.webm?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/74622ffa3aa70e5449e605254d3ffb84.mp4?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore New Frankfurt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your apartment, spend your hard-earned cash on cart upgrades and location permits so you can discover new locations and make even MORE money! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/7e38c525ffa2efa66d7c8f494bb9a630.poster.avif?t=1752092173\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/7e38c525ffa2efa66d7c8f494bb9a630.webm?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/7e38c525ffa2efa66d7c8f494bb9a630.mp4?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respect the powers that be (or not)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, you're not the ultimate authority on hot dogs. Manage the expectations of city officials (and other interested parties), cooperate or disobey, and choose your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/1f5bf35eae45d7f587b9f72406d69a97.poster.avif?t=1752092173\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/1f5bf35eae45d7f587b9f72406d69a97.webm?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/1f5bf35eae45d7f587b9f72406d69a97.mp4?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All things must come to an end, and you can decide how. Will you be forgotten just like any other average joe, or will you go down in history as a legend? Which path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/9d8c717ff5b8b5303ac87c90db1ed73e.poster.avif?t=1752092173\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/9d8c717ff5b8b5303ac87c90db1ed73e.webm?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/9d8c717ff5b8b5303ac87c90db1ed73e.mp4?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to New Frankfurt, big dog! In STREET DOG LEGEND, you can manage your very own hot dog cart! But like it or not, something strange is brewing in the city... and you may stumble right into the middle of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art style inspired by flash games from the 2000s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the street cart your way: Buy upgrades, set up shop at busier locations, and franchise to maximize cash; or just keep things simple - it's up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make life-or-death decisions in a city-wide conflict between the government and its... er... &quot;adversaries.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets, play minigames on your laptop, and forge your own path as a street dog legend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/846a92dd498608df3b5f1268361f38e7.poster.avif?t=1752092173\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/846a92dd498608df3b5f1268361f38e7.webm?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/846a92dd498608df3b5f1268361f38e7.mp4?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A classic cooking simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing beats a day slinging dogs. Fast and high-quality orders served to customers will earn you LOTS of money and - more importantly - fill that empty hole in your heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/