\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/1f5bf35eae45d7f587b9f72406d69a97.webm?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/1f5bf35eae45d7f587b9f72406d69a97.mp4?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All things must come to an end, and you can decide how. Will you be forgotten just like any other average joe, or will you go down in history as a legend? Which path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/9d8c717ff5b8b5303ac87c90db1ed73e.poster.avif?t=1752092173\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/9d8c717ff5b8b5303ac87c90db1ed73e.webm?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757980/extras/9d8c717ff5b8b5303ac87c90db1ed73e.mp4?t=1752092173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
